          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">End the Path if Engaged</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">If the contact replied or booked, end the sales reminder path or remove them from the follow-up workflow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- The Reminder Email -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-green-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-green-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">The Reminder Email</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Subject: Would a short call be useful?</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Hi {{contact.first_name}}, Just following up on your enquiry. If a short conversation would help you decide on the next step, here is my calendar: [Insert booking link]. No pressure if the timing is not right. You can also reply with a question. Best, [Your name]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Send Only One Reminder</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Send one helpful reminder, then end the workflow. A separate Customer Booked Appointment workflow can handle confirmations.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Important Cautions -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-rose-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-rose-100">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Important Cautions</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-3">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Wait Does Not Auto-Stop</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">A simple 1-day Wait does not automatically stop messages when someone books. Configure this logic explicitly.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">SMS Requires Consent</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Do not use SMS without suitable consent, registration, and compliance checks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Exercise for Trainers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Describe two cases when a person should NOT receive the reminder.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Point -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">A Wait action does not automatically know when someone has booked. You must explicitly configure reply checks, booking checks, or removal logic before sending any reminder.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Test, publish and monitor</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add a Wait action</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Insert a 1-day Wait after the first email in your workflow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Add response or booking checks</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Configure conditions to check if the contact has replied or booked before sending a reminder.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Draft one reminder email</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Write a single helpful reminder that ends the workflow after sending.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Add timing and response checks',
      lesson_number = 4,
      sort_order = 4,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Add timing and response checks';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Add timing and response checks

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 17 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 17 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'add-timing-response-checks' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson add-timing-response-checks not found in module 17';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Does a fixed Wait action automatically know when someone has booked an appointment?', 
    '["Yes, Wait automatically stops when a booking is detected","No; you must configure booking or reply checks explicitly","Only if the calendar is integrated with LeadProspectrr","Yes, but only for appointments booked through the workflow link"]'::jsonb,
    'No; you must configure booking or reply checks explicitly',
    'A simple Wait action does not automatically stop messages when someone books. You must explicitly configure reply checks, booking checks, or removal logic in the workflow.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What are two valid reasons to stop a follow-up reminder?', 
    '["The contact opened the email and clicked a link","The contact replied or booked an appointment","The contact visited your website","The contact downloaded a PDF"]'::jsonb,
    'The contact replied or booked an appointment',
    'If a contact has replied to your email or booked an appointment, they have engaged and should not receive a sales reminder. Other actions like opening an email or visiting a website do not necessarily indicate engagement.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'How many reminder emails should the workflow send?', 
    '["Three reminders over one week","One helpful reminder, then end the workflow","Unlimited until the contact responds","Two reminders: one at 1 day and one at 3 days"]'::jsonb,
    'One helpful reminder, then end the workflow',
    'Send one helpful reminder, then end the workflow. A separate Customer Booked Appointment workflow can handle confirmations and reminders for appointments.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
